<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>
  <!--
    The vent's hiss, played by the TXWC_VentReleasing effecter (that def's header) once each time
    the vents open, after CompToxTank's GasPack_Deploy click. Core's GasReleasing (the tox pack's)
    on the same clip, made to play once instead of looping:
    - volumeRange 25, under GasReleasing's 35 and the click's 40, as a toggle opened often should
      sit under the pack's single use. distRange 10~30 is the click's, where GasReleasing takes
      the engine default 25~70: at that default the hiss stays at full volume out to 25 cells
      from the listener, louder than the click whenever the camera is zoomed out, and on the
      click's range it falls off as the rest of the set's sounds do.
    - sustainLoop false schedules the sample to end with its clip (SubSustainer.StartSample), and
      sustainIntervalRange 9999 puts the next one past any vent, so a long vent goes quiet once
      the hiss has played rather than repeating it. The sustainer itself lives on silently until
      the vent closes, so the effecter's SubEffecter_Sustainer, which only respawns an ended
      sustainer, never restarts it mid-vent. Each opening spawns a new effecter and so a new hiss.
    - sustainFadeoutTime 0.3: closing the vent stops the effecter maintaining its PerTick
      sustainer, which ends two ticks later (Sustainer.SustainerUpdate) and fades the hiss over
      0.3 s. GasReleasing has none and cuts dead.
    - tempoAffectedByGameSpeed is left at its default, false, where GasReleasing sets it: a
      non-looping sample is cleaned up at a real-time end scheduled from its clip's length, so a
      clip paused with the game would be cut short on unpausing. The hiss instead plays through
      once at its own pitch at any speed and through a pause, as GasPack_Deploy's one-shot does.
    - maxVoices stays at the default 4, which mutes the farthest past that (SustainerManager);
      GasReleasing's maxSimultaneous 1 only limits one-shots and is dropped.
  -->
  <SoundDef>
    <defName>TXWC_VentRelease</defName>
    <sustain>true</sustain>
    <context>MapOnly</context>
    <priorityMode>PrioritizeNearest</priorityMode>
    <sustainFadeoutTime>0.3</sustainFadeoutTime>
    <subSounds>
      <li>
        <grains>
          <li Class="AudioGrain_Clip">
            <clipPath>Weapon/ToxShell/Toxic_Shell_GasRelease_01b</clipPath>
          </li>
        </grains>
        <volumeRange>25</volumeRange>
        <distRange>10~30</distRange>
        <sustainLoop>false</sustainLoop>
        <sustainIntervalRange>9999~9999</sustainIntervalRange>
      </li>
    </subSounds>
  </SoundDef>
</Defs>
